            <li><strong>Objective 2: Proactive Environmental Adaptation:</strong> To model and implement smart environments (homes, workplaces, public spaces) that anticipate needs based on biometric data, environmental triggers, and user schedules.</li>
            <li><strong>Objective 3: Sustainable Community Integration Models:</strong> To design scalable, ethically sound models for peer support, remote caregiving, and community navigation that empower individuals to maintain independence while accessing necessary human oversight.</li>
        </ul>
    </div>

